Brave ones!

When the great drought began, hope faded from many hearts. Crops withered, rivers dried up, and the land cracked beneath the weight of dust. Yet ancient legends spoke of an artifact of incredible power hidden deep within the Mountains of Singoru — the Horn of Plenty. It is said to restore fertility to the soil, purity to the waters, and hope to the hearts of all.

[b]Event Token — Symbol of Plenty.[/b]
A token resembling the legendary Horn of Plenty. Unfortunately, it doesn’t hold the same power, but a merchant at the market believes that one of these symbols may lead her to the true artifact. She is eager to trade her goods in exchange for them.

[h3]Event Rewards:[/h3]

At the market, you can test your luck by exchanging event tokens for random rewards:
[list]
[*] Weapons from various portals;
[*] Runes for the Academy;
[*] Prism Shards;
[*] Aether Prisms;
[*] Eternity Prisms;
[*] Gold Coins;
[*] Building Materials;
[*] Heroic Manga;
[*] Blueprints;
[/list]
[h3]List of Weapons:[/h3]
[list]
[*] The Requiem;
[*] Lunar Petal;
[*] Tome of Cataclysm;
[*] Lunar Blade;
[*] Flaming Cocktail;
[*] Falling Star;
[*] Edges of Horror;
