Brave ones!

Captain Dave, has decided to set sail on his first voyage across the seas of Singoru. He dreams of adventure, battles and, of course, treasure. However, here's the trouble, once long ago, in a battle with monsters he lost the treasure map, which he is now desperately searching for. 

[u][b]Event Token - Treasure Map.[/b][/u] A seemingly unremarkable parchment, with an image of a landscape and a red cross on it.You can find them by defeating bosses in the vastness of Singoru! 
If you find this map, don't waste time and show it to Dave! Together with him you can unravel its secrets and go on a treasure hunt! However, remember: the more cards you bring, the higher the probability of finding something truly valuable.

