[h2]New weapons:[/h2]

[h3]Reaper of the Depths - Legendary Cursed Sickle. [/h3]
Gives the skill [b]Unholy Barrier[/b].
[list]
[*] +30% to the damage of Unholy Barrier and its evolution on uncommon rarity;
[*] +15% to the damage on an uncommon rarity;
[*] +2 levels of unholy barrier at the start of the match on epic rarity;
[*] +1 level of unholy barrier evolution: you won't pass! on a legendary rare;
